{"version":1,"content":"<p>溫碧霞（Irene）日前出席香港舉行的「第五屆香港紫荊花國際電影節（紫荊花獎）」頒獎典禮，憑於美國拍攝的電影《紐約故事》系列第二單元《夾縫中的百合花》中的演出，榮獲短片競賽單元「最佳女主角」獎項，再為演藝事業增添殊榮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.652520+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:35:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.565898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.652520+00:00","content_hash":"93e4112bc75fba34291b7814cd81e711f1b21eef03867c7f2d7598447b3ac4d0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}